{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act39side_level_act39side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act39side",
  "stageId": "act39side_04",
  "title": "重逢不乏意外",
  "storyCode": "EP-4",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act39side/level_act39side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7cad777b3c7835bb5c0b5635ca2498cdd21b3462571b7a1b99dcbb238e90a767",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g12_alchemyworkshop"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "胳膊和腿都还在，脸也没有破相，就是更黑了点......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是太好了！你不知道我听说他们这些强盗冷血无情、杀人如麻的时候，我有多紧张！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你这都是从哪里听来的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是付出了多大的勇气才敢跑到这里来救你的啊！温蒂还留在镇子里，我这就给她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）等准备好了，我就给她发通讯，然后想办法离开这里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我试过了，逃不出去的，而且，短期内我不打算离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么？难道你真如传言一般加入了强盗的船队？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）老实告诉我，你真觉得在这穷乡僻壤当强盗很有前途吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我对当海盗不感兴趣，极境。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我留下是因为......我想重拾当年自己逃避掉的炼金研究。这可是搭载了心相原质的罗盘......可能就只有这一枚存世了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且......我答应了他们要修好罗盘。没有罗盘，他们很难继续活下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......你以后也打算一直跟他们走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，等到罗盘修好，这些海盗就会离开盐漠，驶向大海。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会留下来，继续在伊比利亚精进自己的剑术与炼金技艺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "极境拍了拍伊西多的肩膀，感觉自己的朋友似乎变了一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来这段日子你有很多感触啊......也好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，外面那个小丫头叫我过来本来是要干什么来着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我修复罗盘的过程中，需要有人帮忙做些辅助操作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那简单，就和在罗德岛一样，有什么需要帮忙的就和我说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会叫你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "伊西多走到塑金台前站定，他手中施术用的探针在空气中划出锐响，精密的法术能量场沿着探针的轨迹逐渐成型。\n他小心翼翼地拆下罗盘的外壳，将它送上塑金台。慢慢地，罗盘内原本凝固的流体物质，也开始随着法术能量流动的方向漾起波澜。\n法术能量与心相原质交相辉映，淡金色的光透过工坊的缝隙，照亮了船外的盐地。\n船员们没见过这样的景象，一个又一个地被吸引而来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "门外的船员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们在搞什么东西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的船员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是那个外面来的小子在搞什么炼啥术......这金光还挺有意思的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "探头的船员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让我看看让我看看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当真，还挺酷的。你手里的这是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g14_ibtown_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_461_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看，那孩子手里是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不屑的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_459_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还能有什么，又一个小鬼为了讨饭耍的把戏呗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_461_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那算了，赶紧走吧，我们可没有多余的口粮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不屑的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_459_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "惹人烦的小鬼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戏法表演！只要一块饼就能观赏，诸位请不要错——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别挡在路中间，到一边去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）呸，混蛋......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g12_alchemyworkshop"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，外面围了好多人，会打扰你吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去把他们赶走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事，有你在这叨叨，我感觉像是回到了之前在罗德岛的工作环境。他们打扰不到我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "伊西多没有停下手中的动作，他手中的探针仿佛在与能量场中荡漾的心相原质舞蹈。\n光芒自他的掌心诞生，在窗外的船员们眼中，像是一场在干渴与饥饿中突然出现的白日梦境。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "门外的船员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你见过这玩意吗？这小子还真会啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的船员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很久之前好像首领讲过差不多的故事，说大的城镇里有变戏法的，看起来就是这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "探头的船员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们想看就让他们看吧，只要别突然冲进来要把我绑了送出去换吃的就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......确实是他们能干出来的事。唉，人咋能这样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......大家都没有吃的就会这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g14_ibtown_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "害羞的孩子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哥哥......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你有吃的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "害羞的孩子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没......没有，我把我的丝带给你好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，你得拿吃的来换。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "害羞的孩子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我自己也没有吃的......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好心的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我这里有几块饼干，给这位小妹妹表演一次吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "饼干？好吧，既然您要求了，当然可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在小伊西多的掌心，金属开始流淌，在黑暗中变幻着色彩。\n街边的路人不由自主地凑了上来，他们嘴上嫌弃地骂着，可眼睛却不曾离开少年手中的流光。\n太久了，这破败的街道上太久没有出现过这样光亮的事物了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "害羞的孩子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真美啊，我可以靠近些看吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "随便你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "少年手指挥动，流淌的金属化作一只羽兽飞向高空，转眼间又化作一尾鳞跃回掌心，化作鼷兽，化作驮兽......\n映着流光的金属驮兽在人群中肆意奔跑，留下仿若星光的碎屑在空中飘散。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_461_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不屑的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_459_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_461_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快闭嘴，好好看着吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上一次看到烟花是什么时候......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像......有很久很久了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "害羞的孩子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烟花？什么是烟花？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "围观的孩子鼓足了勇气伸出手来，接住一粒飘落的星光，自指尖传来的温暖让她不禁颤抖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好心的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是厉害的小家伙，你让这里的人难得地露出了笑容。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是为口吃的罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好心的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好心的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你自己又为何而展露笑容呢，孩子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g12_alchemyworkshop"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "探针牵引着心相原质，让它流淌作一条星河，在空气中蜿蜒。\n船员们越聚越多，窗户上挤满了大大小小的脸。那些因饥渴劳累而灰败的脸，此刻都因伊西多手中的光芒而有了色彩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兄弟，你这是不是有点表演性质了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别以为我看不出来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚才只是检验一下炼金设施和罗盘的状态，现在才该正式从心相原质里分离出那些锈蚀变质了的成分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是我答应他们的......我能做到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g6_olddeck_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，你们怎么聊了这么久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们这么久没见面，当然有很多话要聊啊，老板，你不会一直坐在这里等我吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叫什么老板，太客气了，叫我小毛毛吧，我的朋友都这么叫我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你现在又要和我以朋友相称吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对啊，要不是我这个朋友尽心帮你，你怎么找得到自己的老相识嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（你这丫头是真会颠倒黑白。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让我想想啊......作为朋友你该叫我什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叫什么不都是一嘴皮的事情，你想要我怎么叫都可以！重要的是，那位伊西多大人怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他愿不愿意帮帮忙，罩着点我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，聊得太晚，忘记了。不过你要是嘴甜一点，说不定我明天就能想起来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "求求你了，尊敬的小红毛大人！超级厉害的黎博利！以及世上最最最帅的大帅哥！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不错，爱听，多讲几句！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（啊，可恶，你个傻鸟！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（敢这么要挟我，迟早揪了你那撮红毛！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算啦，算啦。看在你带着我找到了我的朋友......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "极境伸手拍了拍眼前这个个子小小，说话和做事却十分老成，甚至堪称狠毒的小丫头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你年纪这么小，就要在这强盗窝里打拼，要是真有什么解决不了的大事，就来找我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我心地可是很不错的哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......欸？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呸，我才不信你！在这里说什么大话！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要做什么，还是得靠我自己！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ibbar"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "饥饿的船员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再给我一块，谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "饥饿的船员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那种饼......唔......再、再来一盘！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）他们这辈子是没吃过饭吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）您不觉得熟悉吗？这副飞扬跋扈地索取的模样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）这与他们当初劫掠您的粮仓时，有任何不同吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）我不需要他们有什么改变。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳......虽然我相信诸位已经来过雅隆镇许多次了，以一种并不那么和睦的方式......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我还是欢迎你们的到来，并且对接下来要谈的事务满怀期待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "满足的船员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃嗝——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "满足的船员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（举起手臂）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是需要手帕吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "满足的船员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用了，我有袖子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......也好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）呃......谁做的蒜油饼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）您甚至真的相信，您自己能接受他们吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）如果这样能为镇子带来好处的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然诸位已经吃饱，我们也该谈谈——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "满足的船员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你再去给我们整点饼，我要带回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用餐时间已经结束了，现在应该——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "满足的船员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "后面那位先生，别藏着了，过来，我们好好谈谈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "满足的船员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要和你谈，这地方你说了才算，我清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......谈判是证裁官的职责。你们该找西尔弗阁下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g11_meetingroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在这里等了我多久，小哈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我从早上就在了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蒂奇没有和你说吗？我有些私事要去办。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在您身边，我从没见您为私事发过愁。我以为......船队里的事已经将您的生活全部占据。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁说不是呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你来找我是为了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果......我们不用出海也能有其他出路的话，您愿意放弃罗盘吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你打算怎么做？先说说看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些从雅隆逃回来的人说，如果我们交出罗盘与窃贼，就能得到赦免，可以在镇子定居，想去别的地方他们也不会阻拦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你相信了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我核实了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么时候？我怎么不知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您还在养伤，我不想打扰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你不必这样为我着想的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您养育我长大，是我应该的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一转眼，你的个子都比我高了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小时候我总在祈祷，祈祷自己能快点长大，长高一点，强壮一点，这样就能为胡安娜女士分担更多烦恼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在看来，也算如愿了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不论你长多大，在我心里都还是个孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我的想法呢？是否在您眼中，那依然是一个孩子的想法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，小哈，那可不是孩子的想法，是成人的软弱妥协。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我宁可死都不愿向他们投降......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小哈，那些和你一起长大的伙伴，死在他们手中的又有多少？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我忘不了，胡安娜女士......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至今我都铭记在心，最艰难的岁月里，我和我的船员们如何帮助他们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是科鲁兹与我带着自己的船员为他们驱赶前来侵扰的海嗣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我们省出为数不多的口粮，好让他们不必去啃食同类的尸体！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可他们呢！等审判庭一来，他们又毫不留情将我们赶进盐漠深处！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果不是他们见死不救，科鲁兹又怎会沦落到那个境地！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我绝不会向那些忘恩负义的东西低头......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我爱你们所有人，小哈，不论你是否相信，就像我爱当年与我一起在海浪中拼杀的伙伴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然他们早已逝去，从你们这些孩子的脸上，我还能依稀看到他们的模样。这让我不禁感叹，来自血脉的传承是多么神奇的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我无法原谅......请你理解，小哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
